<title>HUNGARY: MOTOR RACING-HUNGARIAN GRAND PRIX PRACTICE TIMES.</title>
<headline>MOTOR RACING-HUNGARIAN GRAND PRIX PRACTICE TIMES.</headline>
<dateline>BUDAPEST 1997-08-08</dateline>
<text>
<p>Leading provisional practice times after Friday's opening practice for Sunday's Hungarian Grand Prix motor race:</p>
<p>1. Michael Schumacher (Germany) Ferrari one minute and</p>
<p>17.583 seconds (average speed 184.122 kph)</p>
<p>2. David Coulthard (Britain) McLaren 1:17.810</p>
<p>3. Jarno Trulli (Italy) Prost 1:17.848</p>
<p>4. Heinz-Harald Frentzen (Germany) Williams 1:17.884</p>
<p>5. Damon Hill (Britain) Arrows 1:18.161</p>
<p>6. Ralf Schumacher (Germany) Jordan 1:18.368</p>
<p>7. Rubens Barrichello (Brazil) Stewart 1:18.565</p>
<p>8. Giancarlo Fisichella (Italy) Jordan 1:18.686</p>
<p>9. Eddie Irvine (Britain) Ferrari 1:18.734</p>
<p>10. Johnny Herbert (Britain) Sauber 1:18.796</p>
<p>11. Jacques Villeneuve (Canada) Williams 1:18.805</p>
<p>12. Jan Magnussen (Denmark) Stewart 1:18.856</p>
<p>13. Gerhard Berger (Austria) Benetton 1:18.923</p>
<p>14. Jos Vertappen (Netherlands) Tyrrell 1:19.346</p>
<p>	 REUTER  081219 GMT aug 97</p>
